# This is a Linux OS project. CRLF is not merely untidy here: the apparmor
# profiles under data/apparmor and the unit files under data/systemd are parsed
# by tools that treat a trailing CR as part of the value.
#
# The Windows checkout this repository was developed in committed 164 files with
# CRLF in the blob, so a fresh clone reproduced them. eol=lf pins the working
# tree regardless of the platform core.autocrlf happens to be set for.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ppm binary
*.bmp binary
*.qcow2 binary
